msgid "# DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp (Experimental)"
msgstr "# DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp（实验性）"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 引言"

msgid ""
"DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp is a multimodal mixture-of-experts model in the\n"
"DeepSeek-V4 family. It combines the DeepSeek-V4 language model with a vision\n"
"encoder and aligner, and accepts text, single-image, and multi-image requests\n"
"through the OpenAI-compatible chat API."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp 是 DeepSeek-V4 系列中的多模态混合专家模型。它将 DeepSeek-V4 "
"语言模型与视觉编码器和对齐器相结合，通过兼容 OpenAI 的聊天 API 接受文本、单图像和多图像请求。"

msgid ""
"Support on vLLM Ascend is experimental and is available on the `main` branch\n"
"with the matching vLLM 0.27.x revision. This guide documents Ascend W8A8\n"
"deployment on one Atlas 800 A3 server or two Atlas 800 A2 servers. Currently,\n"
"only colocated deployment is supported: Prefill and Decode run in the same\n"
"service. Do not use Prefill-Decode disaggregation for this model."
msgstr ""
"vLLM Ascend 上的支持为实验性功能，可在 `main` 分支上使用，并匹配相应的 vLLM 0.27.x 修订版本。本指南记录了在单台 "
"Atlas 800 A3 服务器或两台 Atlas 800 A2 服务器上的 Ascend W8A8 部署。目前仅支持同地部署：Prefill 和 "
"Decode 在同一服务中运行。请勿对此模型使用 Prefill-Decode 分离部署。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持的功能"

msgid ""
"Refer to the [Supported Models](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)\n"
"for the complete support matrix and the\n"
"[Feature Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) for feature configuration."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持的模型](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)获取完整的支持矩阵，并参阅[功能指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)了解功能配置。"

msgid ""
"The A3 configuration in this guide has been validated with W8A8 weights,\n"
"TP4/DP4/EP16, automatic prefix caching, and `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph. The A2\n"
"configuration uses the same global TP4/DP4/EP16 topology across two servers.\n"
"BF16 serving, DSA context parallelism, FlashComm1, and Prefill-Decode\n"
"disaggregation are not covered by this guide."
msgstr ""
"本指南中的 A3 配置已通过 W8A8 权重、TP4/DP4/EP16、自动前缀缓存和 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph "
"验证。A2 配置在两台服务器上使用相同的全局 TP4/DP4/EP16 拓扑。本指南不涵盖 BF16 服务、DSA 上下文并行、FlashComm1 和"
" Prefill-Decode 分离部署。"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件"

