msgstr "为目标硬件使用已发布的镜像。每个镜像都包含匹配的 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend 修订版本："

msgid ""
"Do not replace either package inside the container independently. Mixing other\n"
"vLLM and vLLM Ascend revisions is not supported."
msgstr "请勿在容器内单独替换任一软件包。不支持混用其他 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend 修订版本。"

msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装"

msgid ""
"Select the tab for the target hardware. Run the A2 command on both servers."
msgstr "选择目标硬件对应的选项卡。在两台服务器上运行 A2 命令。"

msgid "=== \"A3 series\""
msgstr "=== \"A3 系列\""

msgid ""
"The A3 server has 8 NPUs, exposed as 16 logical devices (`davinci0`\n"
