msgstr "每台 A2 服务器呈现 8 个 NPU 裸片（`davinci0` 到 `davinci7`）。"

msgid "### 4.2 Verification and Source Build"
msgstr "### 4.2 验证与源码构建"

msgid ""
"Change `MODEL_ROOT` if the checkpoint is stored elsewhere. Keep the same\n"
"absolute model path inside and outside the container, and use the same path on\n"
"both A2 servers."
msgstr "如果检查点存储在其他位置，请更改 `MODEL_ROOT`。保持容器内外的模型绝对路径一致，并在两台 A2 服务器上使用相同的路径。"

msgid ""
"Because the commands start an interactive shell, open another host terminal\n"
"and verify that the container is running:"
msgstr "由于这些命令会启动交互式 shell，请在另一个主机终端中打开并验证容器正在运行："

msgid ""
"Expected output for A3 is similar to the following. For A2, the image name does\n"
