msgstr "A3 的预期输出与以下内容类似。对于 A2，镜像名称没有 `-a3` 后缀。状态以 `Up` 开头表示成功。"

msgid "After entering each container, verify the installed packages:"
msgstr "进入每个容器后，验证已安装的软件包："

msgid ""
"Both packages must be present. To build from source instead, follow the\n"
"[software environment installation guide](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-software-environment)\n"
