msgstr ""
"两个软件包都必须存在。如需改为从源码构建，请遵循[软件环境安装指南](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"software-environment)，并使用 `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` 中匹配的 vLLM "
"修订版本构建 `main` 分支。为目标平台使用特定于硬件的 Dockerfile。"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node A3 Colocated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 单节点 A3 同地部署"

msgid ""
"The validated topology uses four data-parallel engines. Each engine uses four\n"
"tensor-parallel ranks, while expert parallelism spans all 16 ranks."
msgstr "已验证的拓扑使用四个数据并行引擎。每个引擎使用四个张量并行 rank，而专家并行则横跨全部 16 个 rank。"

msgid "Key parameters:"
msgstr "关键参数："

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 4` and `--tensor-parallel-size 4` consume all 16\n"
"  visible logical devices backed by the server's 8 NPUs.\n"
"  `--enable-expert-parallel` distributes MoE experts across the ranks.\n"
"- `--max-model-len 130000` limits the combined input and output length of one\n"
"  request. Reduce it if the service cannot allocate enough KV cache.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs 32` is the maximum number of sequences scheduled by each DP\n"
"  engine. Reduce it first if runtime memory pressure is observed.\n"
"- `--block-size 32` is required by the validated DeepSeek-V4 prefix-cache and\n"
"  sparse-attention configuration.\n"
"- `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` captures decode execution while keeping Prefill outside\n"
"  the full decode graph."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 4` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 4` 消耗服务器 8 个 NPU 支持的全部 16 个可见逻辑设备。`--enable-expert-parallel` 将 MoE 专家分布到各个 rank 上。\n"
"- `--max-model-len 130000` 限制单个请求的输入和输出总长度。如果服务无法分配足够的 KV 缓存，请减小该值。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs 32` 是每个 DP 引擎调度的最大序列数。如果观察到运行时内存压力，请首先减小该值。\n"
"- `--block-size 32` 是已验证的 DeepSeek-V4 前缀缓存和稀疏注意力配置所必需的。\n"
"- `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 捕获解码执行，同时将 Prefill 保持在完整解码图之外。"

msgid ""
"Wait until all four DP engines finish loading weights and graph capture. A\n"
"successful startup includes output similar to:"
msgstr "请等待所有四个 DP 引擎完成权重加载和图捕获。成功启动时输出类似于："

msgid "For general startup issues, refer to the [Public FAQ](../../faqs.md)."
msgstr "有关一般启动问题，请参阅[公共 FAQ](../../faqs.md)。"

msgid "### 5.2 Two-Node A2 Colocated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 双节点 A2 同地部署"

msgid ""
"The A2 deployment uses two servers because each server provides 8 NPU dies.\n"
"Each server runs two local DP ranks with TP4, consuming all 8 dies. Together,\n"
"the two servers form the global DP4/TP4/EP16 topology."
msgstr ""
"A2 部署使用两台服务器，因为每台服务器提供 8 个 NPU 裸片。每台服务器运行两个使用 TP4 的本地 DP rank，消耗全部 8 "
"个裸片。两台服务器共同构成全局 DP4/TP4/EP16 拓扑。"

msgid ""
"Before starting the service, follow\n"
"[Verify Multi-node Communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect).\n"
"Use the same model path and DP RPC port on both servers. Set `NIC_NAME` to the\n"
"interface associated with `LOCAL_IP`, and make sure Node 1 can reach Node 0 at\n"
"`NODE0_IP`."
msgstr ""
"启动服务前，请按照\n"
"[验证多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)进行操作。\n"
"在两台服务器上使用相同的模型路径和DP RPC端口。将`NIC_NAME`设置为与`LOCAL_IP`关联的\n"
"接口，并确保节点1可以通过`NODE0_IP`访问节点0。"

msgid "=== \"Node 0\""
msgstr "=== \"节点0\""

msgid "=== \"Node 1\""
msgstr "=== \"节点1\""

msgid ""
"Start Node 0 first, then start Node 1. Only Node 0 exposes the API endpoint;\n"
"Node 1 runs as a headless worker. The multi-node DP parameters have the\n"
"following meanings:"
msgstr ""
"先启动节点0，再启动节点1。只有节点0暴露API端点；\n"
"节点1作为无头工作节点运行。多节点DP参数的含义如下："

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 4` is the global DP size across both servers.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 2` creates two DP ranks on each server. Each DP\n"
"  rank uses four local dies through TP4, so each A2 server uses all eight dies.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank 0` assigns DP ranks 0 and 1 to Node 0, while\n"
"  `--data-parallel-start-rank 2` assigns ranks 2 and 3 to Node 1.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` points both servers to Node 0, and\n"
"  `--data-parallel-rpc-port` must have the same value on both servers.\n"
"- `--headless` prevents Node 1 from starting another API server."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 4` 是两台服务器上的全局DP大小。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 2` 在每台服务器上创建两个DP rank。每个DP\n"
"  rank通过TP4使用四个本地die，因此每台A2服务器使用全部八个die。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank 0` 将DP rank 0和1分配给节点0，而\n"
"  `--data-parallel-start-rank 2` 将rank 2和3分配给节点1。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` 将两台服务器指向节点0，且\n"
"  `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 在两台服务器上必须具有相同的值。\n"
"- `--headless` 防止节点1启动另一个API服务器。"

msgid ""
"Wait until all four DP engines are ready before sending requests to Node 0."
msgstr "等待所有四个DP引擎就绪后，再向节点0发送请求。"

msgid "### 5.3 Service Verification"
msgstr "### 5.3 服务验证"

msgid ""
"For A3, run the following commands on the serving node. For A2, run them on\n"
"Node 0; replace `127.0.0.1` with the Node 0 IP address when checking remotely."
msgstr ""
"对于A3，在服务节点上运行以下命令。对于A2，在节点0上运行这些命令；\n"
"远程检查时，将`127.0.0.1`替换为节点0的IP地址。"

msgid "Verify the health endpoint:"
msgstr "验证健康检查端点："

msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "预期输出："

msgid "Verify that the configured model is available:"
msgstr "验证配置的模型是否可用："

msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "预期输出："

msgid ""
"An HTTP 200 response and a model entry whose `id` is `dsv4-vision` indicate\n"
"that the service is ready."
msgstr "HTTP 200响应以及`id`为`dsv4-vision`的模型条目表示服务已就绪。"

msgid "### 5.4 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
msgstr "### 5.4 Prefill-Decode分离"

msgid ""
"Prefill-Decode disaggregation is not currently supported for\n"
"DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp. Use one of the colocated deployments in Sections\n"
"5.1 and 5.2."
msgstr ""
"当前不支持对DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp进行Prefill-Decode分离。\n"
"请使用第5.1和5.2节中的共置部署之一。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证"

msgid ""
"Set `IMAGE_URL` to an HTTP(S) URL that is reachable from the serving container,\n"
"then send a multimodal chat-completions request. For the two-node A2 deployment,\n"
"replace `127.0.0.1` with the Node 0 IP address if the request is sent remotely."
msgstr ""
"将`IMAGE_URL`设置为服务容器可访问的HTTP(S) URL，\n"
"然后发送多模态聊天补全请求。对于双节点A2部署，\n"
"如果请求是远程发送的，请将`127.0.0.1`替换为节点0的IP地址。"

msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "预期输出："

msgid ""
"The generated description is stored in\n"
"`response.json` under `.choices[0].message.content`. To use local image files,\n"
"mount their parent directory into the container and add\n"
"`--allowed-local-media-path <DIRECTORY>` to the serving command."
msgstr ""
"生成的描述存储在`response.json`中的`.choices[0].message.content`下。\n"
"要使用本地图像文件，请将其父目录挂载到容器中，并在服务命令中添加\n"
"`--allowed-local-media-path <DIRECTORY>`。"

msgid "## 7 Accuracy Evaluation"
msgstr "## 7 精度评估"

msgid ""
"The merged implementation was validated on OCRBench V1 with 1,000 samples. It\n"
"completed without request errors and scored **826/1000 (82.6)** using the W8A8\n"
"checkpoint, concurrency 64, temperature 1.0, top-p 0.95, maximum output length\n"
"8192, seed 7, and thinking enabled with high reasoning effort."
msgstr ""
"合并后的实现已在OCRBench V1上使用1,000个样本进行了验证。\n"
"使用W8A8检查点、并发数64、温度1.0、top-p 0.95、最大输出长度8192、\n"
"种子7，并启用高推理强度的思考模式，测试无请求错误完成，得分为**826/1000 (82.6)**。"

msgid ""
"For reproducing an accuracy evaluation, refer to\n"
"[Using AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md). Results\n"
"depend on the checkpoint, prompt template, decoding parameters, and dataset\n"
"version; record all of them when comparing runs."
msgstr ""
"要复现精度评估，请参阅\n"
"[使用AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)。结果取决于检查点、提示模板、\n"
"解码参数和数据集版本；在比较运行结果时，请记录所有这些信息。"

msgid "## 8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "## 8 性能评估"

msgid ""
"No production performance baseline is published for this experimental model.\n"
"Use the [AISBench performance evaluation guide](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-performance-evaluation)\n"
"with the deployment in Section 5.1, and report image resolution, input/output\n"
"lengths, request concurrency, TTFT, TPOT, ITL, and throughput."
msgstr ""
"该实验性模型尚未发布生产性能基线。\n"
"请使用[AISBench性能评估指南](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-performance-evaluation)\n"
"配合第5.1节中的部署，并报告图像分辨率、输入/输出长度、请求并发数、TTFT、TPOT、ITL和吞吐量。"

msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid ""
"The values in Section 5.1 are the validated starting point, not globally\n"
"optimal settings. Tune `--max-num-seqs`, `--max-num-batched-tokens`, and\n"
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` together for the target image sizes and sequence\n"
"lengths. Keep the single-node A3 TP4/DP4/EP topology and `--block-size 32`\n"
"until an alternative configuration has been validated."
msgstr ""
"第5.1节中的值是经过验证的起点，并非全局最优设置。\n"
"请针对目标图像尺寸和序列长度，一起调整`--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens`和\n"
"`--gpu-memory-utilization`。在替代配置得到验证之前，请保持单节点A3 TP4/DP4/EP拓扑和`--block-size 32`不变。"

msgid ""
"Refer to the\n"
"[performance tuning guide](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)\n"
"for general tuning methods."
msgstr ""
"有关通用调优方法，请参阅\n"
"[性能调优指南](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。"

msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, please\n"
"refer to the [Public FAQs](../../faqs.md); this chapter only covers\n"
"model-specific issues."
msgstr ""
"有关常见的环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参阅\n"
